{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000009297","bookName":"Las cicatrices que grabaste en mí","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000009297/42000009297.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":1483979,"followCount":40372,"introduction":"Perla Ximénez e Ian Jara vivieron un amor intenso sin que ella supiera que él era un poderoso heredero. Al descubrir su enfermedad terminal y su embarazo, Perla finge ser una mujer interesada y lo abandona para salvarlo, dando a luz en secreto a su hijo, Andrés. Cinco años después, el niño salva a la madre de Ian, pero la maldad de su prometida provoca su muerte. Manipulado, Ian cree que Perla es ambiciosa y el rencor entre ambos se vuelve irreparable.","chapterCount":71,"labels":["Family Bonds","Hidden Identity"],"tags":["Family Bonds","Hidden Identity"],"typeTwoIds":[703],"typeTwoNames":["Familia"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":703,"name":"Familia","replaceName":"familia"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Familia","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"Las-cicatrices-que-grabaste-en-mí","bookNameLower":"las-cicatrices-que-grabaste-en-mí","shelfTime":"2026-04-08 15:39:36","firstShelfTime":"2026-04-08 15:39:36","performerList":[{"performerId":"15344","performerName":"He Qing","performerFormatName":"He-Qing","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x4/15344/15344.jpg?time=1786699957473","videoCount":2},{"performerId":"22569","performerName":"Xinghe Zhang","performerFormatName":"Xinghe-Zhang","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/9x6/22569/22569.jpg?time=1786699957270","videoCount":2}],"performerIdList":[15344,22569]},"chapterList":[{"id":"700596053","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/35/7x9/79x2/792x9/79290000024/700596053_2/700596053.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795219200&Signature=qoygEFU1S9uXB2wazt1U5Eqc6opxaTZVXf60xtgh9H9U60YJh-DXaK30zzF5j6cCtGTce2auCCE24Sjz9JjwmXxcIDqhuORyJuEMniXNTn2XLapQnOzv7KV6j6-63gEHzQ-LoU5OZ3Wmja9y88jBgwyiU6kyLa